# Automations

Scheduled checks for this project.

## Human interface

- `tasks/` contains one editable Markdown file per scheduled task.
- `DASHBOARD.md` — generated status, validation, and next-run overview
- `RUNS.md` — generated run history

## Runtime

`_heartbeat/` contains the local scheduler, validator, generated local agent options, capability cache, SQLite history, and lock state. Treat it as infrastructure; use the heartbeat CLI instead of editing it directly.
